WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:05.889
On the Welcome screen, go to Sync a folder
too and choose a source.

2
00:00:06.459 --> 00:00:11.362
Choose the option for a folder on this
computer, then continue.

3
00:00:11.932 --> 00:00:16.014
Choose Browse, and select the folder that
holds your pictures.

4
00:00:18.792 --> 00:00:22.491
Scry Sync checks the folder and shows what
it found.

5
00:00:24.044 --> 00:00:26.957
Nothing is sent until you press Start.
